<div style="text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;">
  <div style="font-size: 54px; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1;">🎂🎉</div>
  <h2 style="color: #1a1a2e; margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;">Happy Birthday, {{employeeName}}!</h2>
  <p style="color: #D4AF37; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">From all of us at {{companyName}}</p>
  
  <div style="background: #faf8f0; border: 1px dashed #D4AF37; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: left; color: #444; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Dear <strong>{{employeeName}}</strong>,</p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Wishing you a very joyful and fulfilling birthday! We truly appreciate your hard work, talent, and positive energy on the team.</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">May this upcoming year bring you continued health, happiness, and outstanding achievements both personally and professionally.</p>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 24px 0 16px 0;">Have a wonderful celebration today!</p>
  <a href="{{deepLink}}" class="btn" style="display: inline-block; background: #D4AF37; color: #1a1a2e; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;">Visit Employee Portal</a>
</div>
